WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.222
Prepositions locate events and objects in time and place and describe other

00:00:05.222 --> 00:00:05.640
relationships.

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:10.397
Which shows comparison? “Yaw is taller blank Kofi.” Answer: than

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.677
Edit a notice that has missing or misleading prepositions.

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:18.008
Why it works: Than introduces comparison.
